<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Heavy</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Florence Road</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Heavy</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7bOi2P9koS8GKmGBc8wjzU</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.566" end="00:12.381">Called you up when I saw it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.381" end="00:16.024">Took a breath went and walked it off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.024" end="00:19.878">Said it's fine don't you worry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.878" end="00:27.878">Hard to see when it's blurry, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.167" end="00:34.961">Two weeks gone, now I'm falling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.961" end="00:38.768">When will night turn to morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.768" end="00:42.501">Emptied out all of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.501" end="00:49.353">Hold me close, wanna rewind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.353" end="00:51.086">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.086" end="00:54.699">Tell me it’s not that heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.699" end="00:59.431">Lie to my face and beg me not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.431" end="01:01.212">And not to hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.212" end="01:09.212">But just don't tell me it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.398" end="01:16.200">Haven't bought what you sold me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.200" end="01:20.052">Your hope rings like a constant shout</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.052" end="01:23.777">Help me out of this cycle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.777" end="01:30.442">Wanna swap how we think for the rest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.442" end="01:32.375">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.375" end="01:35.959">Tell me it's not that heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.959" end="01:40.719">Lie to my face and beg me not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.719" end="01:43.964">Say it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.964" end="01:45.561">And we'll let it slide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.561" end="01:47.284">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.284" end="01:51.019">Tell me it's not that heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.019" end="01:55.622">Lie to my face and beg me not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.622" end="01:58.454">Say it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.454" end="02:06.454">And we'll let it slide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.662" end="02:10.162">Call it off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.064" end="02:11.954">I'm so sick of crawling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.954" end="02:13.812">Not your fault</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.812" end="02:15.694">See you in the morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.694" end="02:19.141">Will regret never saying something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.141" end="02:26.948">Watch me cry yeah it's all or nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.948" end="02:29.716">Take it all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.716" end="02:37.716">Take it all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.008" end="02:43.911">Tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.911" end="02:48.064">Tell me it's not that heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.064" end="02:56.064">Lie to my face and beg me not to cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.964" end="02:59.984">And tell me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.984" end="03:03.971">Tell me it's not that heavy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.971" end="03:07.971">Tell me that you don't lie awake and think about it too</p></div></body></tt>